cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "TEMPUS: Relativistic coordinate time scales for any solar-system body from arbitrary ephemerides"
message: "If you use TEMPUS, please cite the paper below; the archived software release can be cited in addition."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Seyffert
    given-names: Yan
    affiliation: "Observatoire de la Côte d'Azur, Université Côte d'Azur, CNRS, Géoazur, IRD"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0009-2993-1566"
  - family-names: Fienga
    given-names: Agnès
    affiliation: "Observatoire de la Côte d'Azur, Université Côte d'Azur, CNRS, Géoazur, ARTÉMIS, IRD"
