doi: 10.5281/zenodo.24199182
repository-code: "https://github.com/YanSeyffert/TEMPUS"
abstract: >-
  TEMPUS computes relativistic time-coordinate offsets (e.g. TCX-TCB) by
  numerically integrating the post-Newtonian time-transformation along a target body's
  ephemeris-defined worldline. It is ephemeris-agnostic via use of CALCEPH
  (JPL/INPOP/EPM) and can produce Chebyshev products.
keywords:
  - time scale
  - reference systems
  - ephemerides
  - celestial mechanics
